      "file": "README.md",
      "title": "Reviewed change set is documentation-only and does not implement the PoC spec",
      "detail": "The tracked diff only changes `README.md`, so none of the required deliverables in the spec are actually part of this patch: FastAPI endpoints, React/Vite UI, mask annotation flow, Claude CLI integration, `swim_slow`/`eat` renderer templates, project persistence, failure recovery, or the required test coverage. A spec that introduces seven new capabilities and explicit acceptance criteria cannot be considered implemented by a README-only diff. Include the actual implementation and tests in the reviewed change set, or narrow the scope so the patch matches what is landing.",
