      "file": "README.md",
      "title": "README claims spec compliance using the wrong spec path",
      "detail": "The new `Spec compliance` section says capabilities live under `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`, but this PoC’s specs are under `openspec/changes/sprite-gen-poc/specs/...`. That makes the documentation inaccurate, and combined with the missing implementation it overstates the state of the branch. Point to the actual spec location and avoid claiming compliance until the code is included in the diff.",
